Native JSON nil-to-SQL-NULL behavior follows JSONSerializer.Value in
schema/serializer.go from gorm.io/gorm v1.31.1, used by the pinned
headscale-go v0.29.5 persistence path. The implementation is maintained
in Rust; no Gorm runtime dependency is introduced.
